=================== WHAT IS AND IS NOT ESTABLISHED ===================

ESTABLISHED: the Ir and call counts above on byte-identical cells with two
positive controls that did not move; the wall clock on the two contents and
sizes listed, at 15 paired rounds each; that the heap is unmoved.
NOT ESTABLISHED: any preset but 2 / 6 / 10, any qp but 40, any size but 256 and
512 (photo: 512 only), 10-bit (the bd10 twin `tx_unit_hbd_screened` still
derives its own residual per trial — it is a separate buffer at a different bit
depth and was deliberately left alone), and the inter/video arm's wall clock.
